{"id":"664451","name":"冷泡汁小龙虾","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/664451/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"小龙虾","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"冷泡汁备用。","img":"images/664451/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"小龙虾去虾线和胃囊。","img":"images/664451/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"再把小龙虾刷洗干净备用。","img":"images/664451/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"生姜切片。","img":"images/664451/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"适量香菜洗净备用。","img":"images/664451/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"冷泡汁倒入大盆中，加入适量清水搅拌均匀。","img":"images/664451/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中水开放入姜片煮开。","img":"images/664451/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入小龙虾。","img":"images/664451/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盖上煮开两三分钟左右，捞出过凉水。","img":"images/664451/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"将小龙虾放入碗中。","img":"images/664451/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入香菜。","img":"images/664451/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"淋上冷泡汁，盖上保鲜膜放入冰箱静置入味即可。","img":"images/664451/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664451/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664451/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}